---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Page title="Videos" description="Videos on Kubernetes, DevOps and PipeCD by Rahul Shendre. Starting October 2026.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <span class="kicker">Polaroid wall · the TV</span>
    <h1>Videos, <em>soon</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Starting October 2026: Kubernetes, DevOps, PipeCD, and whatever I'm learning that week, explained the way I wish someone had explained it to me.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat"><b>0</b><span>videos so far</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b>Oct</b><span>first one lands</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><b>{site.links.xHandle}</b><span>where they get posted first</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="read">
    <h2>What they'll cover</h2>
    <ul class="prose">
      <li><b>Kubernetes</b>, from the parts that confused me first.</li>
      <li><b>DevOps</b> and continuous delivery, with PipeCD as the running example.</li>
      <li><b>Things I'm learning</b>, in public, mistakes included.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Follow along on <a href={site.links.x}>X {site.links.xHandle}</a>.</p>
    <p><span class="todo">TODO</span> Add each video to this page (title, date, link) as they go live.</p>
  </div>
</Page>
